flowchart TB
    Request[Website requests camera, microphone, location, or notifications] --> Website[Chromium website permission]
    Website --> PHNX[PHNX PermissionManager]
    PHNX --> Android[Android runtime permission]
    Android --> Decision{User decision}
    Decision -->|Allow| Grant[Grant only if both layers allow]
    Decision -->|Deny| Block[Block gracefully]
    AppSettings[Android App Settings] --> Revoke[User can revoke later]
    Revoke --> Block
    Grant --> Profile[Profile/site-scoped permission state]

    classDef request fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef layer fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef result fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef block fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:1.5px
